# Design system — Chakra UI

Read `.arlox/design-system.json` — this project uses **Chakra UI** v2.

## Rules

- Import from `@chakra-ui/react` — Box, Stack, Button, Input, FormControl, etc.
- Use Chakra props (`colorScheme`, `spacing`, `size`) — not raw Tailwind on components.
- Do not mix antd, MUI, or shadcn in the same project.

## Docs

https://v2.chakra-ui.com/docs/components
